### glxt-api 存储过程 double_value 接口测试脚本
### 使用方式：
### 1. 先在 Oracle 执行 docs/double-value-procedure-test.sql。
### 2. 替换 baseUrl、tenant、token、connectionId。
### 3. 先执行“保存接口配置”，从响应中记录 data.id，替换下面的 apiId。

@baseUrl = http://10.23.114.39:30480
@tenant = glxt
@token = 替换为接口所在分组token
@systemCode = glxt-test
@connectionId = 替换为Oracle数据源ID
@apiCode = doubleValueProc
@apiId = 替换为保存接口返回的data.id


### 0. Oracle 过程定义参考
### CREATE OR REPLACE PROCEDURE double_value (
###   p_num IN OUT NUMBER
### )
### AS
### BEGIN
###   p_num := p_num * 2;
### END;
### /


### 1. 保存存储过程接口配置
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interface/save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "name": "double_value数值翻倍过程",
  "code": "{{apiCode}}",
  "type": 2,
  "description": "Oracle 11g INOUT NUMBER 参数测试：p_num = p_num * 2",
  "orderNo": 1,
  "connectionId": {{connectionId}},
  "fieldBackMode": 1,
  "page": 0,
  "procedureName": "double_value",
  "apiParamList": [
    {
      "name": "输入输出数值",
      "code": "pNum",
      "type": 3,
      "direction": 3,
      "jdbcType": "DECIMAL",
      "orderNo": 1,
      "required": 1,
      "defaultValue": null,
      "validateType": 1,
      "description": "对应Oracle参数p_num，INOUT NUMBER"
    }
  ]
}


### 2. 存储过程调用预览
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interface/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 2,
  "procedureName": "double_value",
  "apiParamList": [
    {
      "name": "输入输出数值",
      "code": "pNum",
      "direction": 3,
      "jdbcType": "DECIMAL",
      "orderNo": 1
    }
  ]
}


### 3. 根据接口ID查询配置
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interface/get
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": {{apiId}}
}


### 4. 根据接口代码查询配置
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interface/get
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{apiCode}}"
}


### 5. 列表查询存储过程接口
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interface/list
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "type": 2,
  "code": "{{apiCode}}"
}


### 6. 分页查询存储过程接口
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interface/page
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "type": 2,
  "code": "{{apiCode}}",
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}


### 7. 获取调用demo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interface/demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{apiCode}}"
}


### 8. 查询接口是否分页
### 预期：存储过程 page=0，返回 false。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interface/have_page
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{apiCode}}"
}


### 9. 执行存储过程：pNum=5，预期返回 pNum=10
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actuator/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "apiCode": "{{apiCode}}",
  "token": "{{token}}",
  "systemCode": "{{systemCode}}",
  "params": {
    "pNum": 5
  }
}


### 10. 执行存储过程：pNum=12.5，预期返回 pNum=25
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actuator/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "apiCode": "{{apiCode}}",
  "token": "{{token}}",
  "systemCode": "{{systemCode}}",
  "params": {
    "pNum": 12.5
  }
}


### 11. 必填参数缺失测试
### 预期：返回错误，提示必传参数pNum不能为空。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actuator/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "apiCode": "{{apiCode}}",
  "token": "{{token}}",
  "systemCode": "{{systemCode}}",
  "params": {}
}


### 12. 必填参数null测试
### 预期：返回错误，提示必传参数pNum不能为空。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actuator/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "apiCode": "{{apiCode}}",
  "token": "{{token}}",
  "systemCode": "{{systemCode}}",
  "params": {
    "pNum": null
  }
}


### 13. 参数类型错误测试
### 预期：返回错误，提示pNum应为数值类型。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actuator/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "apiCode": "{{apiCode}}",
  "token": "{{token}}",
  "systemCode": "{{systemCode}}",
  "params": {
    "pNum": "abc"
  }
}


### 14. 未知参数测试
### 预期：返回错误，提示配置中不存在IN/INOUT参数unknown。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actuator/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "apiCode": "{{apiCode}}",
  "token": "{{token}}",
  "systemCode": "{{systemCode}}",
  "params": {
    "pNum": 5,
    "unknown": 1
  }
}


### 15. 错误token测试
### 预期：权限校验失败，不执行存储过程。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actuator/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "apiCode": "{{apiCode}}",
  "token": "wrong-token",
  "systemCode": "{{systemCode}}",
  "params": {
    "pNum": 5
  }
}


### 16. Excel导出测试
### double_value没有游标，预期导出outParams键值表：name=pNum, value=10。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actuator/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exportExcel": true,
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "apiCode": "{{apiCode}}",
  "token": "{{token}}",
  "systemCode": "{{systemCode}}",
  "params": {
    "pNum": 5
  }
}


### 17. 查询执行记录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actuator/page
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "apiCode": "{{apiCode}}",
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}


### 18. 导出接口配置
### /api/interface/export 只接收 ids，不按 tenant/type/code 过滤。
### 先执行保存接口配置，把响应 data.id 填到顶部 @apiId。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interface/export
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": [
    {{apiId}}
  ]
}


### 19. 清理接口配置，可选
### 注意：执行后会删除接口配置。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interface/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": {{apiId}}
}
